            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.event.EventProperties">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>113.12.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public class EventProperties<fo:block line-height="0pt"/> implements Map&lt;String, Object&gt;</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
The properties for an {@link Event}. An event source can create an
 EventProperties object if it needs to reuse the same event properties for
 multiple events.
 
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The keys are all of type {@code String}. The values are of type
 {@code Object}. The key "event.topics" is ignored as event topics
 can only be set when an {@link Event} is constructed.
 
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Once constructed, an EventProperties object is unmodifiable. However, the
 values of the map used to construct an EventProperties object are still
 subject to modification as they are not deeply copied.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         relative-align="baseline">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                              <fo:block>Since</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>@since 1.3</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         relative-align="baseline">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                              <fo:block>Concurrency</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Immutable </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
